<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Umax Jan-Nov sales at T$5.376b.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Umax Jan-Nov sales at T$5.376b.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Umax Data Systems Inc said on Monday its combined sales revenue for the first 11 months in 1996 soared 66.78 percent to T$5.376 billion from T$3.223 billion in the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>In November alone, Umax posted sales revenue of T$907 million, up 129.6 percent from T$395 million in November 1995, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no profit figures.</p>
<p>Umax attributed its revenue increase to booming sales of its main products, image scanners.</p>
<p>Umax has set a 1996 net profit target of T$564 million on sales of T$6.235 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
